       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. The dose is well above the safe maximum, and it may be a transcription error.\n\n**The problem:**\n- **Each dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times a day comes to **6400 mg/day**. That's twice the prescription maximum of 3200 mg/day. Doses this high raise the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and heart problems, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**What you may have meant:**\n- **1600 mg as the daily total:** that would be **400 mg four times daily**, a common order.\n- **A high-dose anti-inflammatory regimen:** **800 mg three times daily** (2400 mg/day) or **800 mg four times daily** (3200 mg/day, the maximum).\n\nPlease confirm the dose and frequency you want, and I'll enter it right away."
      }
